---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import { getRelativeLocaleUrl } from 'astro:i18n';
const lang = 'en';
const t = (await import('../../translations/en.json')).default;
---

<Layout lang={lang} title={t.nav.grammar} description="Simpli grammar: analytic, minimal rules.">
  <h1>{t.nav.grammar}</h1>
  <p>Simpli uses an <strong>analytic grammar</strong> inspired by Indonesian.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Word order:</strong> Subject – Verb – Object.</li>
    <li><strong>Verbs:</strong> Never change form. Time with words (yesterde, now, tumoro).</li>
    <li><strong>Possession:</strong> Noun + possessor: <em>haus mi</em> = my house. You can add <em>of</em> for clarity, but it’s not needed: <em>haus (of) mi</em>, <em>haus (of) broder (of) mi</em> = my brother’s house.</li>
    <li><strong>Plurals:</strong> Optional.</li>
    <li><strong>Questions:</strong> Start with wat, hu, wer, wen, wai, hou.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(lang, 'grammar-rules')}>View full list of grammar rules →</a></p>
</Layout>

<style>
  ul { padding-left: 1.25em; list-style: disc; margin: 0.5em 0 1em; }
</style>
